
二、Responsibilities工作职责
(a)Be responsible to manage the operation of China Innovative Drug Clinical Operations Business Unit，realize the strategic target of CID-COBU , ensure organization to support business development, achieve the quality and business objectives of CID-COBU，establish the Business Unit development plan, achieve the business objectives of CID-COBU.
负责创新药国内临床运营事业部的运营管理，落地事业部战略发展目标，确保组织架构支撑业务发展需要，建立部门发展计划，完成事业部的业务目标。
(b)Be responsible to build and maintain the good relationship with important CIDCOBU-related business clients，clinical GCP office & investigators and various regulatory authorities.
负责维系与重要客户、临床机构和研究者及相关监管部门保持良好关系。
(c)Be responsible to coordinate and supervise the clinical trial project operation and monitoring management on site，to ensure these trials completed on time, within budget and in compliance with related regulations, guidelines and our SOPs, to provide the practical skills training, resource coordination support in CID-COBU if necessary.
负责临床试验项目运行及中心监查管理的监管和协调工作，以确保临床试验进程符合既定要求、成本控制在预算内并保证临床试验的操作符合相关法规、指导原则及泰格SOP，为团队成员提供必要的实践技能培训及资源协调支持。
(d)Identify key points and risks in clinical trial implementations, and coordinate to develop corresponding resolutions and risk-based management plans.
识别临床试验执行过程中的关键点和风险，并协调开发相应的解决方案和基于风险的管理计划。
(e)Be responsible to support the company’s business development department in determining the business development strategies and participating important GCP-related BD activities if necessary.
负责为商务发展部提供必要的支持，如需要，参加GCP相关的重要商务活动等。
(f)Manage all of functional department teams of CID-COBU, including performance management, personal development, coaching/mentoring, and actively seeking to provide developmental opportunities. 
管理临床运营事业部各职能部门团队，包括部门绩效管理、员工发展、培训/辅导以及积极提供发展机会。
(g)Be responsible to work with HR Dept. for CID-COBU related staff training, keeping and developing CID-COBU talents. 
负责储备和培养临床运营事业部的人才。
(h)Be responsible to provide support to other functional departments on GCP-related activities and affairs
负责为其他职能部门提供必要的相关GCP事务支持。
(i)Attend industry conference on behalf of Tigermed as needed. 
根据需要代表泰格参加业界会议。 